Subject: [ReXGlue] merge s7c/texdirect

Class: RGO
What: At resolution_scale > 1, a compute shader writes scaled texture loads straight into the image instead of a scratch buffer + copy.
Evidence: Verify 0 mismatches in 31,400 / 45,626 loads (runs 166 / 172); 4K GPU -3.40 ms/frame (run 167); docs\upstream\vulkan_texture_load_direct.md.
On / off: vulkan_texture_load_direct (+_verify), off.
Commit: b627cbc (diff against b627cbc^1)
Prepared by the WWE 2K14 recomp project (Session 15, prep only, not sent). Measured on one PC (Ryzen 9 5950X, RTX 4090), Vulkan backend, one title.

